            "review_text": "Fabio G\n3 contributions\n0\nTerrible, crooks, scammed, read all reviews.\nNov 2025 • Family\nREAD ALL THE REVIEWS! Ok so was very excited to go here, lovely location. Food was nice, view was great! But wish I read the REVIEWS!! They over charged us by miles. Our meal was meant to be £28, and instead it was £49. They over charged on everything. And to be honest the service was terrible. They also play dumb alot when you ask them prices even when your using a translator they act dumb. Clearly playing games to scam tourists or foreigners\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDon't go, they litreally rob you blind. Seems decently priced, then they chuck in loads of scam fees\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 22, 2025",
