            "review_title": "Review at Banh tom Ho Tay",
            "review_text": "phương hà đông\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nFood quality is too bad, service attitude is bad\nApr 2024 • Couples\nOn the evening of April 20, I had dinner with a friend. I have to say that the quality was nothing more boring. I ordered a plate of 6c spring rolls for 150k, a plate of shrimp cakes for 90k, and a plate of steamed squid with sim, which was tiny, only a few pieces. The head and intestines haven't been removed yet, the ink is still black, who dares to bite, 150k, to be honest, that place is 50k not worth it, grilled oysters with cheese 40k/piece, cheese chewed like straw, other restaurants 25k with delicious cheese sauce, large fresh oysters. Beer is 40k/bottle, double that outside. The service attitude was as I expected, the face was hard, but there was also a 10k service fee, and 10k for parking, which cost money to go out to eat and also cost a parking fee. Total damage 600k. I'll never go back, I feel like I was robbed. If I don't know how to cook, I'll close the shop. It's just that there are few restaurants in that lake, but there's nothing good to eat there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 22, 2024",
